{"c":[{"id":"21e9ae58ea94a1ed","sum":"v2/access lacks v2.yml/record-snapshots.yml: carry sam/v2/ci workflows/Swift 6.3 fixes onto v2/** (snapshots/record). rig-run accepts a memory file of whole GiB 4-12 beside display; ops/heavy seals it. Default 4 GiB lacks GPU memory for 3.4 GB Gemma.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T082841Z-f6fa2a2274a3373e","text":"v2/access (2026-10-09) has no .github/workflows/v2.yml or record-snapshots.yml; those live on sam/v2/ci with Swift 6.3 perch fixes, so CI for a branch off v2/access needs a carrier commit with them pushed to a v2/** branch (and snapshots/record).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T094824Z-62ada46022b5500b","text":"rig-run takes an opt-in memory file (whole GiB, 4-12) beside display; ops/heavy seals it (c0afa4d1). The 3.4 GB Gemma model runs out of GPU memory at the default 4 GiB.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"06b7217beca7b83b","sum":"macOS 26 rig system-wide AX returns -25204 for focus/app while app AX works; AXRead.focusedElement falls back to frontmost app (DF1 20261009T091737Z-83186). caret-heavy prune deletes inputs/vm-job/runs; copy guest evidence out before pruning r2-vm.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T094824Z-d932ee9a36702a5a","text":"In the macOS 26 rig guest the system-wide AX element answers -25204 for its focused element and app while the app's own element works; AXRead.focusedElement falls back to the frontmost app (DF1 run 20261009T091737Z-83186).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T094824Z-f579be04c067ac3a","text":"caret-heavy prune deletes inputs/vm-job/runs (the whole guest evidence); copy the run directory out before pruning an r2-vm job.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
